abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of the decoupling criterion for translation-invariant
  topological CSS codes, the correctness of the decoupling algorithms, the polynomial cost of Algorithm 2,
  minimal coarse-graining, logical qudits on tori, and the glued-code example.
